---
title: Bossrush and world tiers
pageSlug: bossrush
modpack: sc-final-adventure
section: gameplay
order: 2
---

The pack is explore, get stronger, kill the next named thing, then mess with gems and spells until you are bored.

**Explore.** Overworld, caves, other dimensions. Structures are content. If you only follow the highway to a fortress you will miss half the loot tables.

**Get stronger.** Quests, materials, world tiers. Affixes and gems matter as much as “is this netherite.” A clean rare chestplate will carry you longer than a raw upgrade you cannot support.

**Kill the next named thing.** Cataclysm bosses and the **gateway** fights are the real endgame. The gateways are not a side activity you do after credits. They are the credits.

**Stay in the loop.** Enchants, gems, spells, relics. Replay is “I took the bosses in a different order” and “I committed to this school this time.”

If you are stuck, it is usually gear tier or a quest you closed. Open the book. The next chapter is almost always the hint.
